<title>USA: First Albany Cos sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>First Albany Cos sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Cos Inc said on Wednesday that its board has approved a five percent stock dividend payable May 27 to shareholders of record on May 12.</p>
<p>Prior to the stock dividend, First Albany had 5.17 million shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
